`,a.jsxs(e.p,{children:["The page follows the exercise's two graded jobs in four parts, plus one staff run. ",a.jsx(e.em,{children:"Six arms against four backends"})," runs a whole sequence through six attention shapes on the four backends of scaled-dot-product attention (SDPA). ",a.jsx(e.em,{children:"Eager against compiled"}),", the staff run, compiles every arm on ",a.jsx(e.code,{children:"CUDNN_ATTENTION"})," and splits one forward into the parts of the model. ",a.jsx(e.em,{children:"The decode step"})," times one new token against a cache for each kind of attention. ",a.jsx(e.em,{children:"The attention sinks"})," reads the perplexities the same job computes. ",a.jsx(e.em,{children:"The window-tradeoff run"})," times kernels that can skip the window's tiles, counts the positions eviction would keep, and reads the supplied trio of trained models."]}),`
