`,a.jsx(te,{src:ue,alt:"Six panels in two rows. Top row: sink perplexity against the window, falling toward a dashed full-context line, the with-sinks line below the window-only line and closest to it at the widest window, a random-position cross on the window-only line and an equal-cache square on the with-sinks line. Beside it, semantic attention FLOPs as filled bars inside open realized bars, the windowed arms' filled bars well under half. Bottom row: stored cache elements falling from multi-head to grouped-query to latent attention; peak memory with MATH bars far above the fused backend's for every arm; prefill MFU bars per backend, MATH lowest, a star above the multi-head bars and a dotted line higher still; decode step latency on log axes, rising with the cache, multi-head above grouped-query and absorbed latent attention, unabsorbed latent attention highest.",caption:"comparison.png. The top row holds what the model computes, the bottom row what it costs. The prefill MFU panel marks the compiled point with a star and the large matrix multiplication with a dotted line."}),`
